  "item_short_desc": "<p>Worn while traveling through a desert, snowstorm, or any extreme weather conditions, Rothco&rsquo;s Gadsden Shemagh Keffiyehs offer adaptability to any environment. Crafted from breathable woven cotton, they provide both comfort and durability, shielding your head and neck from the sun, snow, and debris. Versatile in functionality, they serve as a face covering, neck gaiter, headwrap, and more, with a generous size of approximately 42 inch x 42 inch, allowing for various wrapping styles to suit your needs.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "3412",
  "description": "<p>Worn while traveling through a desert, snowstorm, or any extreme weather conditions, Rothco&rsquo;s Gadsden Shemagh Keffiyehs offer adaptability to any environment. Crafted from breathable woven cotton, they provide both comfort and durability, shielding your head and neck from the sun, snow, and debris. Versatile in functionality, they serve as a face covering, neck gaiter, headwrap, and more, with a generous size of approximately 42 inch x 42 inch, allowing for various wrapping styles to suit your needs. These tactical desert scarves aren't just for fashion; they're essential survival tools that can be manipulated and used as a makeshift sling, tourniquet, pouch, and much more&mdash;making them a must-have addition to your bug out bag or 72-hour kit. Trusted by active-duty personnel worldwide, they not only provide practical utility but also serve as a fashion accessory for those who appreciate both style and functionality in their outdoor gear.</p>",
